# sabotage=PassesDropCalls behind a pass over the whole program: a call of an unknown function is gone. The pass sends a call of a known function to another version of it, and answers for that call alone: the build stops
# FORM: Prepared
# RUN: pass SplitFreshResults
# DIAGNOSTIC: VerificationFailedAfterPass 1
# OPTIONS: check=VerifyEachPass sabotage=PassesDropCalls
# PROGRAM-OF: passes-drop-calls-left-alone.ir
